<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-010" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:family" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:family:m0000" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">王夷甫</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:family:m0003" ref="4rl_6u1_b3j">婦</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:family:m0005" ref="28k_44w_ibb">郭泰寧</persName>女，</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:zhugong" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:zhugong:m0000" ref="28k_44w_ibb">郭豫</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:zhugong:m0003" ref="28k_44w_ibb">太寧</persName>，太原人。仕至相國參軍，知名。早卒。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yang" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yang:m0000" ref="pfd_g6t_zy5">陽</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yang:m0002" ref="pfd_g6t_zy5">景祖</persName>，高尚人。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yang:m0009" ref="hgm_jvn_hle">武帝</persName>時為幽州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:money" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:money:m0000" ref="4rl_6u1_b3j">婦</persName>欲試之，令婢以錢遶床，不得行。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:money:m0016" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">夷甫</persName>晨起，見錢閡行，謂婢曰：「舉卻阿堵物。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yangqiu" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:yangqiu:m0000" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">夷甫</persName>善施舍，父時有假貸者，皆與焚券，未嘗謀貨利之事。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:wangyin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-010-jin043-wangyan:wangyin:m0000" ref="b0c_13f_c3a">夷甫</persName>求富貴得富貴，資財山積，用不能消，安須問錢乎？而世以不問為高，不亦惑乎！</p>
</text>
